# Real dataset names, not typos.
dota
mot

# Real model names: D-FINE and its ONNX exporter.
dfine

# codespell splits `pResx` / `pResy` / `pRes` in Canvas.rotate_point as if the
# word were "pres"; the locals are short for "result x / y".
pres

# A real typo, deliberately parked.  `widget.tr("Show Degress")` is the
# View-menu item and its translation ("显示旋转角度") lives in zh_CN.ts keyed by
# that misspelling.  Renaming the source string therefore drags in the whole
# catalog chain: recompile the .qm *and* regenerate the blob embedded in
# resources.py, or the lookup silently misses and the item falls back to
# English.  It is worth doing -- but as a dedicated i18n pass that also
# settles the `widget.tr(...)` extraction problem (see the note in
# CHANGELOG), not as a side effect of a lint cleanup.
degress
